    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests for the Match Rating Approach (MRA) phonetic algorithm. <p>The MRA algorithm encodes names phonetically to support fuzzy name matching. The encoding pipeline is: clean → remove vowels (except word-initial) → remove double consonants → take first 3 + last 3 letters. <p>Test method naming convention: {@code test<FeatureArea>_<InputDescription>_<ExpectedOutcome>} <p>Corner-case inputs (null, empty, single-character, whitespace-only) are labelled \"CornerCase\" in the method name."
   },
